---
/**
 * Domain root — the Vanikar Games portfolio.
 *
 * Card Games lives at /cardgames/; later titles get their own /<product>/
 * namespace beside it and a card on this page. Keeping every product in a
 * subfolder of one domain lets them share its authority, which is the whole
 * reason the marketing sites are not on separate subdomains.
 */
